Z||000002||cobra427||05-28-2000||11:12 PM||||Fiero64,<BR>84-85 4 sp=3.0 qts.  code R  4cyl<BR>86----4 sp=3.0 qts.  code 9  6cyl<BR>86----5 sp=2.7 qts.  code 9  6cyl<BR>87-88-5 sp=2.7 qts.  note Isuzu MT2=2.7 qts.<BR>                     2.0 qts.=MuncieMG2<P>taken from Chiltons R/M<BR>cobra<P><BR>||||reg||1
